  {
   "id": "goodbye-volcano-high-134589@major-2022-11-30",
   "gameId": "goodbye-volcano-high-134589",
   "displayName": "Goodbye Volcano High Release Date Update + Teaser",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-30T16:02:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As many of you have likely guessed, Goodbye Volcano High will not be making its targeted 2022 release. We have made the difficult decision to push its launch to Summer of 2023.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This has been a learning experience for us: producing an ambitious project for our studio's size, with over 6000 voiced lines, and a large number of bespoke animations. We care about this game and the story we're telling so much, and want to deliver something that is in line with what we've always envisioned for this game. It's what you deserve!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We understand this delay might be disappointing, but we are confident this is the right decision and that it will be worth the wait.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the meantime, we hope you enjoy this teaser trailer — it's a sneak peek of what we've been working on for the past little while!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re intrigued and haven’t joined our community, you can become a member of our Discord or follow us on TikTok, Twitter, and Instagram, where we’ll be continuing to post even more updates on all or most of these channels in the New Year.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The whole team at KO_OP is beyond excited for everyone to play Goodbye Volcano High when it’s ready, and we thank you so much for your patience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "----",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can find the full version of the song featured in our teaser (\"Don't Call\" by Dabu ft Brigitte Nagger) on YouTube or Bandcamp. 😘",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
